message: "Please cite the peer-reviewed Frontiers article for the scientific findings. Cite the reproducibility artifact separately when reusing its code or data."
title: "The AI Incident Disclosure Shadow — reproducibility artifact"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Frozen inputs, per-incident coding records and deterministic analysis code
  supporting the study of AIID-recorded AI incidents and their visibility in
  subsequent U.S. securities filings. The study measures disclosure in a
  specified filing universe, not legal compliance.
